    "type": "game",
    "name": "ASMR Studio Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3351390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMR Studio Simulator is a game that lets you craft and enjoy custom ASMR sessions. Think of it like a chill ASMR sandbox. Perform ASMR on your clients, decorate your studio, and attract colorful new clients from around your neighborhood. There's no wrong way to play or difficult decisions to make. Just sit back, relax, and explore tingly ASMR  in your cozy little virtual world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/7c50659dd3afc0735f20f95019f8b28f.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/546afb9ffffb243c3b9d9fd66555819c.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/546afb9ffffb243c3b9d9fd66555819c.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/546afb9ffffb243c3b9d9fd66555819c.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to your custom ASMR creations. You can actively control the triggers or set them up and let the game take over. Put on your headphones and feel the tingles wash over you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/73cf8ef652b2b66a9ff514905929283e.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/169d75e7fa994699d3f6d4584ad8b6d9.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/169d75e7fa994699d3f6d4584ad8b6d9.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/169d75e7fa994699d3f6d4584ad8b6d9.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need for money in this game. Instead, earn 'Tingle Points&quot; when you work on clients and use them to buy new decorations for your studio. Customers will also leave you gifts which you can proudly put on display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/3b4702e5d2e6f4d0fad66f08e60458a2.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/8e9b50ba9dff14a4bc0cbece3c150bab.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/8e9b50ba9dff14a4bc0cbece3c150bab.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/8e9b50ba9dff14a4bc0cbece3c150bab.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from hundreds of ASMR triggers to add to a session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specify the movement pattern, speed, and duration of each trigger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the volume and microphone type of the triggers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the background sounds and locations for added ambience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply enjoy dozens of premade ASMR sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/094aa3eca646317eeaab04f10baac80d.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/c04d64652c67dc8d8fcf3cacd9cb7620.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/c04d64652c67dc8d8fcf3cacd9cb7620.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/c04d64652c67dc8d8fcf3cacd9cb7620.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a colorful cast of clients and learn their stories. Each time they come in for a booking, they'll tell you a little more about their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/0278f5999501cd21762a8877b1f0cc15.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/a478e7e09cfb1fb889b434c5895ff2be.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/a478e7e09cfb1fb889b434c5895ff2be.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/a478e7e09cfb1fb889b434c5895ff2be.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your studio exists in a cheery little world. Over time, you will increase your curb appeal and beautify the neighborhood.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASMR Studio Simulator is a game that lets you craft and enjoy custom ASMR sessions. Think of it like a chill ASMR sandbox. Perform ASMR on your clients, decorate your studio, and attract colorful new clients from around your neighborhood. There's no wrong way to play or difficult decisions to make. Just sit back, relax, and explore tingly ASMR  in your cozy little virtual world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/7c50659dd3afc0735f20f95019f8b28f.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/546afb9ffffb243c3b9d9fd66555819c.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/546afb9ffffb243c3b9d9fd66555819c.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/546afb9ffffb243c3b9d9fd66555819c.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to your custom ASMR creations. You can actively control the triggers or set them up and let the game take over. Put on your headphones and feel the tingles wash over you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/73cf8ef652b2b66a9ff514905929283e.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/169d75e7fa994699d3f6d4584ad8b6d9.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/169d75e7fa994699d3f6d4584ad8b6d9.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/169d75e7fa994699d3f6d4584ad8b6d9.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need for money in this game. Instead, earn 'Tingle Points&quot; when you work on clients and use them to buy new decorations for your studio. Customers will also leave you gifts which you can proudly put on display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/3b4702e5d2e6f4d0fad66f08e60458a2.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/8e9b50ba9dff14a4bc0cbece3c150bab.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/8e9b50ba9dff14a4bc0cbece3c150bab.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/8e9b50ba9dff14a4bc0cbece3c150bab.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from hundreds of ASMR triggers to add to a session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specify the movement pattern, speed, and duration of each trigger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the volume and microphone type of the triggers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the background sounds and locations for added ambience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or simply enjoy dozens of premade ASMR sessions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/094aa3eca646317eeaab04f10baac80d.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/c04d64652c67dc8d8fcf3cacd9cb7620.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/c04d64652c67dc8d8fcf3cacd9cb7620.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/c04d64652c67dc8d8fcf3cacd9cb7620.mp4?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a colorful cast of clients and learn their stories. Each time they come in for a booking, they'll tell you a little more about their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/0278f5999501cd21762a8877b1f0cc15.avif?t=1739113992\" width=610 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/a478e7e09cfb1fb889b434c5895ff2be.poster.avif?t=1739113992\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/a478e7e09cfb1fb889b434c5895ff2be.webm?t=1739113992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351390/extras/a478e7e09